{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first three levels of BALLSHAKERZ: A Climbing Game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shake It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/1_Shake.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click to shake your balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to get to the goal at the top of the screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Win</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/2_Win.gif?t=1746502956\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to go higher and higher each level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to drop your balls.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Will Lose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/3_Lose.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't want your balls to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the level before you run out of time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Balling Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/4_Balls.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a lot of balls?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher your score, the more you start with.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A one button control scheme so you can still play after you smash your keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfair, no skill mechanics so you can lose without feeling bad about it...maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless levels for all you Sisyphus enjoyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balls you can (legally) play with in public.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by Maou Damashii.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665990?t=1746502956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665990?t=1746502956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/37a483b00257b3275b037804f6d18bc8101cbb21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746502956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/37a483b00257b3275b037804f6d18bc8101cbb21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746502956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first three levels of BALLSHAKERZ: A Climbing Game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shake It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/1_Shake.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click to shake your balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to get to the goal at the top of the screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Win</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/2_Win.gif?t=1746502956\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to go higher and higher each level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to drop your balls.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Will Lose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/3_Lose.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't want your balls to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the level before you run out of time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Balling Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/extras/4_Balls.gif?t=1746502956\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a lot of balls?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher your score, the more you start with.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A one button control scheme so you can still play after you smash your keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfair, no skill mechanics so you can lose without feeling bad about it...maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless levels for all you Sisyphus enjoyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balls you can (legally) play with in public.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by Maou Damashii.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bergeronimo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3665640","name":"BALLSHAKERZ: A Climbing Game."},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665990/0fd49c0c8a9b659706703666392d1deb591955f6/header.jpg?t=1746502956","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131996,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131996/movie480.mp4?t=1746502954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131996/movie_max.mp4?t=1746502954"},"name":"BALLSHAKERZ Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131996/b8e13559c018416717484f58bb510e5188b620fb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746502954","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131996/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746502954","max